WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.425
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.425 --> 00:00:05.756
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.756 --> 00:00:09.256
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.256 --> 00:00:09.596
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.596 --> 00:00:13.597
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:17.288
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:17.442 --> 00:00:21.788
Select the context-only alternative to inspect error feedback.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:27.847
Check the selected answer and read the training explanation.

00:00:27.847 --> 00:00:31.110
Advance to the second question after reviewing the feedback.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:35.443
Select the explanation that context can affect inference without weight updates.

00:00:35.443 --> 00:00:41.286
Check the second answer and read its feedback.

00:00:41.286 --> 00:00:44.571
Advance to the final question.

00:00:44.571 --> 00:00:48.945
Choose the experiment that keeps the model fixed while changing the input.

00:00:48.945 --> 00:00:52.242
Check the final answer and compare the experimental reasoning.

00:00:52.242 --> 00:00:57.533
Inspect the 2/3 result and the completed-question counter.

00:00:57.533 --> 00:01:02.041
Start another attempt with the same three questions.

00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:06.398
Correct the first question by selecting numerical model parameters.

00:01:06.398 --> 00:01:13.911
Check the corrected answer and read the updated feedback.
